ourism Development"},{"box":[[267.0,1211.0],[1500.0,1211.0],[1500.0,1243.0],[267.0,1243.0]],"confidence":0.946232,"text":"Through the integrated effects of the aforementioned equations, the model provides a sci-"},{"box":[[199.0,1251.0],[1502.0,1251.0],[1502.0,1283.0],[199.0,1283.0]],"confidence":0.944174,"text":"entific foundation and policy recommendations for the sustainable development of tourism. The"},{"box":[[198.0,1286.0],[1503.0,1290.0],[1502.0,1329.0],[197.0,1325.0]],"confidence":0.924168,"text":"Dynamic Equation for Tourists Volume facilitates rational growth in visitor numbers by reg-"},{"box":[[197.0,1331.0],[1503.0,1330.0],[1503.0,1363.0],[197.0,1364.0]],"confidence":0.923403,"text":"ulating infrastructure and environmental pressures, thereby avoiding overcrowding. The Infras-"},{"box":[[197.0,1372.0],[1503.0,1372.0],[1503.0,1404.0],[197.0,1404.0]],"confidence":0.910562,"text":"tructure Level Equation enhances tourist experiences and resident satisfaction through increased"},{"box":[[197.0,1412.0],[1504.0,1412.0],[1504.0,1444.0],[197.0,1444.0]],"confidence":0.91936,"text":"investment in infrastructure, alleviating traffic congestion and the strain on public services caused"},{"box":[[198.0,1451.0],[1504.0,1451.0],[1504.0,1484.0],[198.0,1484.0]],"confidence":0.932866,"text":"by the influx of visitors. The Environmental Degradation Equation mitigates environmental"},{"box":[[198.0,1493.0],[1503.0,1493.0],[1503.0,1525.0],[198.0,1525.0]],"confidence":0.941504,"text":"deterioration by increasing investment in environmental protection, safeguarding critical tourism"},{"box":[[195.0,1529.0],[1501.0,1532.0],[1500.0,1568.0],[194.0,1565.0]],"confidence":0.922014,"text":"resources such as the Mendenhall Glacier. The Resident Satisfaction Equation improves sup-"},{"box":[[198.0,1573.0],[1503.0,1571.0],[1503.0,1604.0],[199.0,1606.0]],"confidence":0.93535,"text":"port for tourism by enhancing infrastructure and public services, addressing challenges such as"},{"box":[[197.0,1613.0],[1502.0,1613.0],[1502.0,1646.0],[197.0,1646.0]],"confidence":0.915541,"text":"housing pressure and community alienation caused by tourism commercialization. Finally, the"},{"box":[[199.0,1653.0],[1500.0,1653.0],[1500.0,1685.0],[199.0,1685.0]],"confidence":0.921816,"text":"Tax Revenue Model Equation supports balanced economic growth and environmental conser-"},{"box":[[200.0,1694.0],[1501.0,1694.0],[1501.0,1726.0],[200.0,1726.0]],"confidence":0.926623,"text":"vation by allocating tax revenues to environmental protection, infrastructure, and public services."},{"box":[[200.0,1733.0],[1501.0,1733.0],[1501.0,1765.0],[200.0,1765.0]],"confidence":0.934677,"text":"Through a closed-loop feedback mechanism, this model establishes a positive cycle of \"revenue-"},{"box":[[197.0,1775.0],[1501.0,1772.0],[1502.0,1804.0],[198.0,1807.0]],"confidence":0.910341,"text":"generation-protection-experience enhancement,\" offering a quantifiable pathway for Juneau"},{"box":[[199.0,1815.0],[1502.0,1815.0],[1502.0,1844.0],[199.0,1844.0]],"confidence":0.929313,"text":"and other tourism destinations facing similar challenges to achieve their sustainable development"},{"box":[[194.0,1855.0],[280.0,1848.0],[283.0,1883.0],[196.0,1890.0]],"confidence":0.776109,"text":"goals."},{"box":[[1459.0,2047.0],[1615.0,2047.0],[1615.0,2073.0],[1459.0,2073.0]],"confidence":0.855301,"text":"关注数学模型"},{"box":[[1458.0,2104.0],[1617.0,2104.0],[1617.0,2131.0],[1458.0,2131.0]],"confidence":0.835954,"text":"获取更多资讯"}],"page_index":14,"rendered_file":"tmp/q159-extraction-v1/P-B-2025-2509557-c800a325/rendered/page-0014.png"}
{"engine_elapsed":[0.37169,0.036242,4.381067],"image_sha256":"a8e58cac52008d9e1847a67d68dc59608a5a98b971159a14863dc943dac2a212","lines":[{"box":[[201.0,100.0],[425.0,100.0],[425.0,127.0],[201.0,127.0]],"confidence":0.810266,"text":"Team # 2509557"},{"box":[[1314.0,99.0],[1502.0,99.0],[1502.0,129.0],[1314.0,129.0]],"confidence":0.850305,"text":"Page 24 of 24"},{"box":[[200.0,210.0],[1000.0,213.0],[1000.0,252.0],[199.0,249.0]],"confidence":0.888256,"text":"Memo to the Tourist Council of Juneau"},{"box":[[200.0,289.0],[806.0,289.0],[806.0,318.0],[200.0,318.0]],"confidence":0.933447,"text":"Dear Members of the Juneau Tourist Council,"},{"box":[[264.0,347.0],[1500.0,348.0],[1500.0,381.0],[264.0,380.0]],"confidence":0.926908,"text":"To address overtourism's impacts on the environment, economy, and society, our team de-"},{"box":[[200.0,388.0],[1502.0,388.0],[1502.0,420.0],[200.0,420.0]],"confidence":0.934697,"text":"veloped a system dynamics model for sustainable tourism. Using Juneau as a case study, we"},{"box":[[199.0,429.0],[1205.0,429.0],[1205.0,458.0],[199.0,458.0]],"confidence":0.911368,"text":"conducted detailed analyses. Below are our findings and recommendations:"},{"box":[[199.0,494.0],[894.0,494.0],[894.0,523.0],[199.0,523.0]],"confidence":0.93223,"text":"Model Predictions and Effectiveness of Measures"},{"box":[[266.0,557.0],[1499.0,558.0],[1499.0,588.0],[266.0,587.0]],"confidence":0.94543,"text":"Our model shows that the number of visitors to Juneau will always be above the environmen-"},{"box":[[198.0,598.0],[1501.0,598.0],[1501.0,630.0],[198.0,630.0]],"confidence":0.931087,"text":"tal capacity, which may cause a negative impact on the local community. And at the same time,"},{"box":[[198.0,636.0],[1500.0,639.0],[1499.0,672.0],[197.0,669.0]],"confidence":0.963574,"text":"rational taxation and resource allocation can reduce environmental pressures while improving res-"},{"box":[[198.0,678.0],[1502.0,678.0],[1502.0,710.0],[198.0,710.0]],"confidence":0.912282,"text":"ident satisfaction and infrastructure. For instance, raising the tax rate to 6.3% and imposing a $50"},{"box":[[198.0,717.0],[1501.0,717.0],[1501.0,753.0],[198.0,753.0]],"confidence":0.896016,"text":"entry fee can control visitor numbers within the environment's carrying capacity. Allocating 30%"},{"box":[[200.0,758.0],[1501.0,760.0],[1501.0,790.0],[199.0,788.0]],"confidence":0.939345,"text":"of tax revenue for environmental improvement, 40% for infrastructure, and 30% for public services"},{"box":[[200.0,799.0],[976.0,799.0],[976.0,832.0],[200.0,832.0]],"confidence":0.917142,"text":"will enhance Juneau's appeal and residents' quality of life."},{"box":[[200.0,865.0],[1015.0,865.0],[1015.0,895.0],[200.0,895.0]],"confidence":0.914692,"text":"Strategic Recommendations for Sustainable Development"},{"box":[[255.0,928.0],[1502.0,928.0],[1502.0,961.0],[255.0,961.0]],"confidence":0.892266,"text":": Short-Term (1-3 years): Increase tax rates (e.g., 6.3%) to control visitor numbers and"},{"box":[[277.0,964.0],[1247.0,968.0],[1247.0,1003.0],[277.0,1000.0]],"confidence":0.939503,"text":"ensure at least 25% of tax revenue is invested in environmental recovery."},{"box":[[255.0,1032.0],[1501.0,1032.0],[1501.0,1065.0],[255.0,1065.0]],"confidence":0.924204,"text":": Mid-Term (3-5 years): Reduce tax rates to 5%, prioritize infrastructure investment (40-"},{"box":[[279.0,1072.0],[1411.0,1070.0],[1411.0,1105.0],[279.0,1107.0]],"confidence":0.943271,"text":"45%), and increase per capita expenditures ($600-700) to boost resident satisfaction."},{"box":[[255.0,1139.0],[1502.0,1139.0],[1502.0,1171.0],[255.0,1171.0]],"confidence":0.912269,"text":": Long-Term (5+ years): Maintain high investments in environmental protection (40%) and"},{"box":[[278.0,1177.0],[1501.0,1178.0],[1501.0,1211.0],[278.0,1210.0]],"confidence":0.952899,"text":"infrastructure (45%) to stabilize tourism growth while keeping the environmental index low"},{"box":[[279.0,1218.0],[445.0,1214.0],[445.0,1247.0],[280.0,1251.0]],"confidence":0.849123,"text":"(0.45-0.50)."},{"box":[[201.0,1292.0],[694.0,1291.0],[694.0,1321.0],[202.0,1322.0]],"confidence":0.894444,"text":"Applications to Other Destinations"},{"box":[[237.0,1352.0],[1501.0,1353.0],[1501.0,1392.0],[237.0,1391.0]],"confidence":0.921366,"text":"By adjusting key parameters (e.g., Qinfra, T, Spub), this model can support solutions for over-"},{"box":[[196.0,1394.0],[1496.0,1396.0],[1495.0,1429.0],[196.0,1427.0]],"confidence":0.963427,"text":"tourism in other destinations like Sanya. It also promotes under-visited areas by improving infras-"},{"box":[[197.0,1437.0],[1391.0,1437.0],[1391.0,1469.0],[197.0,1469.0]],"confidence":0.900121,"text":"tructure and ecological measures, attracting more tourists and balancing regional tourism."},{"box":[[197.0,1499.0],[454.0,1499.0],[454.0,1534.0],[197.0,1534.0]],"confidence":0.885888,"text":"Potential Impacts"},{"box":[[255.0,1565.0],[1501.0,1565.0],[1501.0,1598.0],[255.0,1598.0]],"confidence":0.924803,"text":": Resident Support: Improved public services and infrastructure raise satisfaction above"},{"box":[[280.0,1605.0],[656.0,1607.0],[655.0,1637.0],[280.0,1635.0]],"confidence":0.902569,"text":"0.80, easing social tensions."},{"box":[[274.0,1670.0],[1502.0,1672.0],[1501.0,1702.0],[274.0,1700.0]],"confidence":0.939676,"text":" Ecological Benefits: Reduced environmental pressure enhances recovery for sensitive areas"},{"box":[[280.0,1710.0],[659.0,1711.0],[658.0,1741.0],[280.0,1740.0]],"confidence":0.899451,"text":"like the Mendenhall Glacier."},{"box":[[258.0,1775.0],[1497.0,1777.0],[1496.0,1809.0],[258.0,1807.0]],"confidence":0.963163,"text":" Sustainable Growth: Optimized policies attract higher-quality tourists and ensure long-"},{"box":[[281.0,1817.0],[598.0,1817.0],[598.0,1844.0],[281.0,1844.0]],"confidence":0.912459,"text":"term economic benefits."},{"box":[[266.0,1900.0],[1502.0,1900.0],[1502.0,1932.0],[266.0,1932.0]],"confidence":0.929619,"text":"These strategies will help Juneau address overtourism and serve as a replicable model for"},{"box":[[197.0,1939.0],[1500.0,1941.0],[1499.0,1973.0],[197.0,1971.0]],"confidence":0.927917,"text":"sustainable tourism. We recommend implementing short-term measures promptly and establishing"},{"box":[[199.0,1982.0],[900.0,1982.0],[900.0,2012.0],[199.0,2012.0]],"confidence":0.917247,"text":"monitoring systems to guide long-term optimization."}],"page_index":25,"rendered_file":"tmp/q159-extraction-v1/P-B-2025-2509557-c800a325/rendered/page-0025.png"}
